From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kebab refactor <kebab@local.invalid>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:39:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: wcd938x: initialise the TX channel HPF on analogue mic
 enable

wcd938x_codec_enable_adc() never touches the per-channel high-pass
filter init bit; only the DMIC path calls wcd938x_tx_channel_config().
The vendor driver pulses it on every analogue TX enable, at the start
and end of PRE_PMU.

Without it an analogue microphone capture starts with an uninitialised
HPF on that channel and the recorded level is far below what the same
path produces once the bit has been cycled. Measured on sm8250
(OnePlus 8T): AMIC capture sat around -66 dBFS regardless of gain.

Mirror the vendor sequence in the AMIC enable path.
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c
index c69e18667..ef61a7b2e 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c
@@ -1167,6 +1167,9 @@ static int wcd938x_get_adc_mode(int val)
 	return ret;
 }
 
+static void wcd938x_tx_channel_config(struct snd_soc_component *component,
+				      int channel, int mode);
+
 static int wcd938x_codec_enable_adc(struct snd_soc_dapm_widget *w,
 				    struct snd_kcontrol *kcontrol, int event)
 {
@@ -1182,6 +1185,16 @@ static int wcd938x_codec_enable_adc(struct snd_soc_dapm_widget *w,
 					      WCD938X_DIGITAL_CDC_ANA_CLK_CTL,
 					      WCD938X_ANA_TX_DIV2_CLK_EN_MASK, 1);
 		set_bit(w->shift, &wcd938x->status_mask);
+		/*
+		 * Pulse this channel's high-pass filter init bit. The vendor
+		 * driver does this on every analogue TX enable -- set early in
+		 * PRE_PMU and clear at the end of it -- while mainline only
+		 * does it on the DMIC path, so an AMIC capture runs with the
+		 * channel's HPF never initialised and records a heavily
+		 * attenuated signal.
+		 */
+		wcd938x_tx_channel_config(component, w->shift, 1);
+		wcd938x_tx_channel_config(component, w->shift, 0);
 		break;
 	case SND_SOC_DAPM_POST_PMD:
 		snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD938X_DIGITAL_CDC_ANA_CLK_CTL,
